    "value": "> **At a glance:** The new storefront design is produced by the **Accenture Song Design & Digital Products team** and delivered to the Accenture build squads in two phases. Designs are still in progress and **not yet fully signed off** - always check the status tracker below before building. Figma is the single source of truth; this page points to it and tracks what's ready.\n\n1. Context\n----------\n\nZimmermann's new web design for the SFCC storefront is being created by the **DDP design team**. It is delivered in **two phases** and consumed by the Accenture delivery squads as build input. Because the designs are evolving and signed off incrementally, this page does not hold the designs themselves - it links to the live Figma workspace and tracks sign-off status so the build team always knows what is safe to build.\n\n2. Ownership & boundary\n-----------------------\n\n* **DDP team** owns design production - wireframes, visual design, prototyping, and the design system.\n* **Accenture** builds to **signed-off designs only**. UX design production is outside Accenture's scope.\n* A page or component is **not buildable scope until its design is signed off**.\n* Any design change after sign-off is managed through **change control**\n\n3. Phases\n---------\n\n**Phase 1**: core shopping journey: Homepage · Global navigation & footer · PLP · PDP · Cart · Mini-cart · Boutique locator\n\n**Phase 2**: account & loyalty surfaces: Login / Register · My Account dashboard · Order history & detail · Returns history · Address book · Saved cards · Wishlist · VIC / loyalty surfaces\n\n4. Sign-off status tracker\n--------------------------\n\n> Check this before starting build on any area. Only **Signed Off** designs are buildable. If status is Draft or In Review, do not build - raise with Jasijn Tsang. **Owner of this tracker:** Jasijn Tsang · **Last updated:**\n\n| **Area / Page** | **Phase** | **Figma link** | **Status** | **Notes** |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Homepage | 1 | [LINK](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=1863-7980&p=f&t=Q5Ckaumxe7GQfwfM-0) | READYGreen |  |\n| Global navigation & footer | 1 | [Header](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=2436-50887&p=f&t=Q5Ckaumxe7GQfwfM-0) | In Review |  |\n| PLP (category & landing) | 1 | [LINK](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=240-81&p=f&t=Q5Ckaumxe7GQfwfM-0) | READYGreen |  |\n| PDP | 1 | *[link]* | IN REVIEWYellow |  |\n| Cart & mini-cart | 1 | *[link]* | IN REVIEWYellow |  |\n| Boutique locator | 1 | *[link]* | In Review |  |\n| Login / Register | 2 | *[link]* | IN REVIEWYellow | Not ready for build |\n| My Account dashboard | 2 | *[link]* | DRAFTRed | Not ready for build |\n| Order history & detail | 2 | *[link]* | DRAFTRed | Not ready for build |\n| Returns history | 2 | *[link]* | DRAFTRed | Not ready for build |\n| Address book | 2 | *[link]* | DRAFTRed | Not ready for build |\n| Saved cards | 2 | *[link]* | DRAFTRed | Not ready for build |\n| Wishlist | 2 | *[link]* | DRAFTRed | Not ready for build |\n| VIC / loyalty surfaces | 2 | *[link]* | DRAFTRed | Not ready for build |\n\n*Status key: **Draft** (in design, not for build) · **In Review** (with stakeholders) · **Signed Off** (buildable) · **Changed** (re-review needed after a post-sign-off change).*\n\n5. Links\n--------\n\n**Figma**\n\n* 🔗 **DDP Figma workspace**: <https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=240-81&p=f&t=Q5Ckaumxe7GQfwfM-0>\n\n**Background presentations** *(context only - may be superseded by current Figma)*\n\n* 🔗 *[UX direction / design presentation]* — *[date]*\n* 🔗 *[Earlier presentation]* — *[date]*\n\n6. How we work with design\n--------------------------\n\n* **Build only to Signed Off frames.** If an area isn't signed off, it isn't in buildable scope yet.\n* **Raise design questions or gaps** with the DDP team via *[channel 